# Input

```svelte
{#each animals as animal, i}{i}: {animal}{/each}

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1 +1,3 @@
-{#each animals as animal, i}{i}: {animal}{/each}
+{#each animals as animal, i}
+    {i}: {animal}
+{/each}
```

# Output

```svelte
{#each animals as animal, i}
    {i}: {animal}
{/each}
```
